    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_7f3e7527",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: shiba_inu_under_table; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image features a Shiba Inu dog lying under a table, with the text overlay 'im going trans hunting'. This juxtaposition uses the dog's innocent, slightly mischievous expression to mock or threaten individuals who identify as transgender. The phrase 'trans hunting' is a derogatory and hateful trope that implies targeting, persecution, or violence against transgender people. It maps the visual of a harmless animal onto a violent, discriminatory intent, thereby normalizing and amplifying hostility toward the transgender community. This meme is designed to spread hate and incite harm against a protected group based on gender identity, fitting squarely within the 'hateful' category as it directly attacks individuals based on their gender identity.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_5388bb58"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
