      "instance_name": "trans_hunting_stereotype",
      "label": "Trans Hunting Stereotype",
      "description": "A derogatory and hateful trope that implies targeting, persecution, or violence against transgender people. It is often used to justify discrimination, harassment, or threats against transgender individuals, and is rooted in anti-transgender bigotry and hate speech. This concept is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the hateful intent of the meme's text overlay.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
